              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ethĩwa Mũlivai akooka kuma mbingĩlonĩ syaku o na syĩva nthĩnĩ wa Isilaeli onthe, vala wekalaa ũeni, akyũka na kwenda kw’onthe kwa ngoo yake vala Yeova wĩnyuva; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
