        {
          "text": "Yĩla mwathani ũneenaa syĩtwanĩ ya Yeova, ethĩwa ũndũ ũsu ndwĩĩthĩwa, o na ndwĩĩkĩka, ũu nĩw’o ũla Yeova ũtaaneena: mwathani ũsu aneenete na mĩtavyo, ndũkamũkĩe. ",
